        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVOliOF8tD3k43jiDGsSRdR9Jq3czSwfOVK7a6G0D6Af7Uw8QwlKQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Friends of mine came to visit from out of town and wanted to go check out this shoe store. As soon as we came in the blonde girl was speaking French to us, which my friends didn't understand as they're from out of province. She proceeded to give us attitude the whole time we were there and told us not to touch the shoes that she would have to come get them for us. She made us very uncomfortable. Will never return.",
        "time": 1768516882,
        "translated": false
      },
